{"id": "swebq0059", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1026234309, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "8c3af78f4533df26d66383d6216ec5cacb9faa8bb324f3d6a6d51641beeea3a9", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "where are ike and tina turner's children?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0059.wav", "input_sha256": "3f2c321fd4d50394ef1c1f9f236fe4a4fe4f42473fb57510c96cac57cfced225", "input_samples": 32676, "input_s": 2.042, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.8078, "act": 0.9988, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Ike and Tina Turner raised four sons: Craig Raymond Turner — Tina’s son with Raymond Hill, adopted by Ike. He died by suicide on July 3, 2018, at his home in Los Angeles. (biography.com) , Ronnie Turner — Ike and Tina’s only biological child together. He has lived a private life; the last widely reported update said he was in a Southern California convalescent home after strokes/seizures and using a wheelchair. (biography.com) So, as of now, Michael Turner appears to be the only surviving one of the four sons Tina raised, though he is largely out of the public eye.", "expert_answer": "Ike and Tina Turner raised **four sons**:\n\n- **Craig Raymond Turner** — Tina’s son with Raymond Hill, adopted by Ike. He **died by suicide on July 3, 2018**, at his home in Los Angeles. ([biography.com](https://www.biography.com/musicians/a44004123/tina-turner-children))  \n- **Ronnie Turner** — Ike and Tina’s only biological child together. He **died on December 8, 2022**, from complications of colon cancer and cardiovascular disease. ([biography.com](https://www.biography.com/musicians/a44004123/tina-turner-children))  \n- **Ike Turner Jr.** — Ike’s son with Lorraine Taylor, adopted by Tina. He was a musician/producer and **died on October 4, 2025**, in Los Angeles from kidney failure. ([latimes.com](https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/music/story/2025-10-06/ike-turner-jr-dead-son-ike-tina-tuner))  \n- **Michael Turner** — Ike’s son with Lorraine Taylor, adopted by Tina. He has lived a private life; the last widely reported update said he was in a **Southern California convalescent home** after strokes/seizures and using a wheelchair. ([biography.com](https://www.biography.com/musicians/a44004123/tina-turner-children))  \n\nSo, as of now, **Michael Turner appears to be the only surviving one of the four sons Tina raised**, though he is largely out of the public eye.", "transcript": "Where are Ike and Tina Turner's children?\n", "asr_s": 0.59, "expert_s": 18.47, "expert_input_samples": 32676, "expert_input_s": 2.042, "expert_input_sha256": "3f2c321fd4d50394ef1c1f9f236fe4a4fe4f42473fb57510c96cac57cfced225", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 17.017, "relay_synth_ms": 35155, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 1664, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 1869, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0059_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "160b001b16144fa6ccb169149dc859bc9556bbccaaf5fbe22db26757d31d7086", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 35.32}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0059_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "7e20433066ad4b57de28972f4bdfc21193982f4d655626c21c6ee9f54b09c0ec", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0059_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "4acaca771b056f5fe4f5ec58d77f2e775d398a49c41f726d290c56af25a851f9", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.8}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.125, 1.232, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.14, 2.248, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.042, 2.378, 2.488, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.042, 3.178, 4.603, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.042, 5.835, 6.649, 0, 19200, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end":