Playing for Keeps** (2012)\n- **Olympus Has Fallen** (2013)\n- **How to Train Your Dragon 2** (2014, voice)\n- **Gods of Egypt** (2016)\n- **London Has Fallen** (2016)\n- **Geostorm** (2017)\n- **Den of Thieves** (2018)\n- **Hunter Killer** (2018)\n- **How to Train Your Dragon: The Hidden World** (2019, voice)\n- **Angel Has Fallen** (2019)\n- **Greenland** (2020)\n- **Copshop** (2021)\n- **Last Seen Alive** (2022)\n- **Plane** (2023)\n- **Kandahar** (2023)\n- **Den of Thieves 2: Pantera** (2025)\n- **How to Train Your Dragon** (2025, live-action)\n\nHe is especially known for **300**, **The Phantom of the Opera**, **P.S. I Love You**, **Law Abiding Citizen**, **Olympus Has Fallen**, **Den of Thieves**, and **Plane**. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gerard_Butler_filmography?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "What movies Gerard Butler has been in?\n", "asr_s": 2.76, "expert_s": 8.17, "expert_input_samples": 42335, "expert_input_s": 2.646, "expert_input_sha256": "9ffd8c461d2dda233fc3acfd0f5c44cec5073d253a6b505534864c06e47539cb", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 9.164, "relay_synth_ms": 40194, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 1042, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 1042, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0114_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "cf62fb32f2228aa92b3a51a72fb2c52610983022b1560254bbdbaa96e21f5d14", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 40.2}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0114_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "0ca1f0e87b805e4ed3f48cb6b678cd28e24f1c20abe6410e446ea8bc3ebf1530", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0114_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "452469aeb1d5df5d8fe2511afa25f84f78e3d536000c4154cb2717d9247233ee", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.64}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.116, 1.215, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.12, 2.216, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.646, 2.764, 2.865, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.646, 3.767, 4.693, 0,